TVLWeightedContainers::getContainer()
├── when container ID is zero
│   └── it should return empty container with all fields set to zero/false
├── when container ID does not exist
│   └── it should return empty container with all fields set to zero/false
├── when container ID exists
│   ├── it should return correct container data with all fields
│   └── it should set currentDurationEpochs to duration.min on creation
├── when container state changes
│   └── it should return updated isActive status after activation
└── when multiple containers exist
    └── it should return correct data for each container independently
